<title>BELGIUM: EU sees 97/98 beet sugar output down to 16 mln t.</title>
<headline>EU sees 97/98 beet sugar output down to 16 mln t.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has forecast 1997-98 beet sugar production falling to 16.0 million tonnes, down from 16.5 million this season, an EU member state official said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
